<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan forces bombed an ELN camp in Apure, killing at least 19 combatants, and a separate bomb attack in western Colombia killed four civilians. President De la Espriella is expanding militarization along the Venezuelan border as the ultra-right government moves the army onto the streets. Cuts to the human-rights court threaten its ability to address abuses. Former M‑19 leader Antonio Navarro Wolff, architect of the 1991 constitution, died. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPc1ZSZlJhZnhXbWtIVDhwaTZWeGVLQlo5LVhGZ3kzcnVicUQ5dXVEOFNCWDlZcHR6M2YyV2NVN0pCTGphYy1sTlpLbXp0dXB5ekk0c0p2Z1A5N3AxVTB6dGVxajVKLTJHcGFiVW82a21HenJTdkQzcndRV21uaXc5R1ZTWk9JVlUwU3B2OVlyYVNSakZ3d0JVcWRPY3pzcG94UlJXZGd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOak1pVkRWMkd4SWtVbjBvbnE4a2dWSHpMNFlJbGhxYl9fNmVsX09CeWVkN2E3dXlzQTRhLUJvMm1YYllLeW84SEpRS0xqTHFCOXFPZHB0NVkwSFFOcXI3MFRvUUFRbW5PYndtQXlGeHRYUXoxSl9DN0FRWGI3Zm1URF9haHliaVpIQnZtNlBzUk05U0Y1ck1wa3RocDloNy0yQV9GNnpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Arabiya English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNbFRrbEZlRnRFbUNzZnpVTEFVZWdvLXRjNXQzYnZjR0ZkeUh0MmlzamU0eWRrbXdjY0RfckZDdWVwVlUyd3MyV2NtUkZtaEllcVJvM3hKd0dLLThGNG1JLXkxam5sODJ4WTloWWFwNUxTUW1YOHFmeDlGaXp1RTRfSXVyRE5uR2p3YXZNLUNNWExvblVRNUVr?oc=5&quot;&gt;LBCI Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTFBQWUU1T0hpcHFaUGI4UXVXOGgzZW52bU1NN0dsNzlGM28zU3VjaVhwZ1YxajlBaEZ5a2NZdlhJbGN4QlM1N1RicTEyV2xXN0t0aEI0OVRJT2JUeHlBTzR5ak9GV3ZUT1FmR1VfeUxKb0pEalFNRGw4SmxTQk9mUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;albawaba.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot